Army Jay OSD — licensing
========================

This repository contains three kinds of material, under two different
licences, plus some third-party files that are neither.

If you are a pilot who just wants to fly with this font: use it, share it,
put it in a pack, remix a glyph. Credit "Army Jay OSD" and you are fine.


1. Code — MIT
-------------

Everything under `tools/` and `tests/`, plus `variants.toml` and the CI
configuration.

